        {
          "text": "nkabela wakaya kuyoocinga Asa, wamwaambila kuti, Amundiswiilile, Asa anyoonse nuba-Juda aba-Benjumini. Jehova uli anywe na muli awe. Na mwamuyandaula, ulajanwa kulindinywe, pele na mwamulekelezya, alakwe ulamulekelezya inywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
