        {
          "text": "Lino Maaka banyina mwami Asa, wakabanyanzya bulemu buelede banyina mwami, nkaambo kakuti kacitide cikozyano cisesemya acifwanikisyo cakupaila. Asa wakajaya cikozyano cabo, wacipwayaula, wacitenta kukalonga ka-Kedroni. ",
